rdians of the  galaxy and thor spider-man ant-man  hawkeye these are all characters that  had contact with t'challa but didn't  have really a relationship with him they  either fought with him in avengers  in-game or fought against him in captain  america's civil war but also an end game  everybody fought together but it was  kind of a mess so they didn't really  have time to talk but here are the  characters that could show up and like i  said there could be some old ones but  i'm expecting some new ones as well now  right away i am not expecting captain  america to show up but there has been a  lot of talk of chris evans returning  although he has denied these rumors i do  think it would be cool if he did a quick  little cameo just to show up to show his  love for t'challa but i'll group captain  america with the less likely people to  show up however his two best friends i  think should show up to the funeral  bucky of course and then sam they all  fought together in wakanda and of course  they all made amends after civil war  bucky even went back to wakanda it would  make sense if these two showed up to  show their respect then we have bruce  banner the hulk now the hulk is  appearing in she-hulk so we know  marvel's not afraid to put the hulk in  other shows or movies and he was a big  part of the fight in avengers infinity  war at wakanda plus not to mention he  was a brilliant scientist and he clearly  saw how advanced wakanda was and how  smart shuri was and i'm sure he'd love  to go visit wakanda again and of course  pay his respects and then i would  actually expect war machine to show up  and not only because he fought alongside  of t'challa and avengers infinity war in  wakanda but also as kind of a  representation of america showing their  support for wakanda he's very high up in  the military and he was a friend it just  makes sense for him to show up all  around now speaking of the x-men and  mutants in wakanda forever obviously  neymar in the comics 